PROSE SUMMARY (context, not a substitute for the structured log above)
---------------------------------------------------------------------
Short 14-turn game. Anhedonia's Cryolinx (buffed via Makeshift Handgun +200) destroyed DeftCHIMP's Pengullet and Katress in successive combat trades (turns 7, 10), and Anhedonia's Jormuntide Ignis later destroyed DeftCHIMP's Lyleen Noct (turn 13) after its attack was bare-form interrupted by DeftCHIMP's Foxparks on turn 12 - the only interrupt of the game. Twin Lamballs chipped DeftCHIMP steadily (10->9->8->7->6, turns 10 and 13) while DeftCHIMP's own Leezpunk/Pengullet/Katress had chipped Anhedonia early (10->9->7->5). Anhedonia closed with Cryolinx (2) and a buffed Jormuntide Ignis (4) for lethal on turn 14 (6 to 4 to 0).


